{"title":"Reaver","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 261 total, 99–162 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bandit: <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/brigand\">Brigand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\">Cutthroat</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/highwayman\">Highwayman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">Sellsword</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/enforcer\">Enforcer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain\">Outlaw Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/a0170e59ed8f65bfd7f3.webp\" alt=\"Reaver\"></div><h3>Reaver</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>28</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bandit</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>106</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>19.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1400</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>Not yet</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}